  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_3258.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La Orkesta Pelillo, con sus particulares versiones de punk-rock, ha cerrado el ciclo de cuatro conciertos organizado por el local Pakopes con motivo de las fiestas patronales de Tales, con dos sesiones este s&aacute;bado por la tarde y de noche, hasta bien entrada la madrugada.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3219.jpg\" alt=\"img_3219\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3222.jpg\" alt=\"img_3222\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3226.jpg\" alt=\"img_3226\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3227.jpg\" alt=\"img_3227\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3229.jpg\" alt=\"img_3229\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3231.jpg\" alt=\"img_3231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3234.jpg\" alt=\"img_3234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3235.jpg\" alt=\"img_3235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/orkestapelillopakopestardor14/img_3239.jpg\" alt=\"img_3239\" style=\"max-width:100